I walk to the wooden court.
There is good light there.
Kiran, Sara, and Vishnu are playing there.
I like to watch their game.
I stand there to watch it.
They play very well.
Then Sara sees me.
She smiles at me.
Kiran and Vishnu stop the game.
They also look at me.
Sara waves her hand at me.
"Do you like to play?" Sara asks.
"Are you coming to play with us?" she asks.
"Can you play badminton?" Kiran asks.
I happily walk towards them.
"Yes, I can play," I reply.
"I like to play very much," I say.
They happily call me to the court.
I am going to play with them.
